Advanced power control, communication and OT study (@pe-ot-study: 0, is #chapter, #part-of @electrical-power-engineering, #source "../sources/Operational-Technology-Security-NIST-800-82.lingua#r_760JSBVFVK2NXS6RE3HQJKK8P5", #source "../sources/Industrial-Control-and-SCADA-O-and-M-FIST.lingua#r_1REAMQSK7H73C2DY277VJW2ZTB", #source "../sources/Management-of-Protective-Relay-Settings-FIST.lingua#r_11X2AGDKXQ69S5GZYNK21Y8CW6", #source "../sources/Conduct-of-Power-Operations-and-Maintenance-FIST.lingua#r_4JS2N9S01A3KTMH37TXMVSPPYC", #electrical-power-engineering "../study/An-integrated-electrical-power-system-investigation.lingua#r_06BN864FF9C0AN3EWZJE78Y6Y3") { r_1NTDJ3RFNA1EPMD14PXN0BC0EM
**Read:** [Guide to Operational Technology Security — NIST SP 800-82r3](../sources/Operational-Technology-Security-NIST-800-82.lingua#r_760JSBVFVK2NXS6RE3HQJKK8P5), complete applicable final report; [Industrial control and SCADA operation/maintenance — FIST 3-33](../sources/Industrial-Control-and-SCADA-O-and-M-FIST.lingua#r_1REAMQSK7H73C2DY277VJW2ZTB), entire relevant manual; [Management of Protective Relay Settings — FIST 6-4](../sources/Management-of-Protective-Relay-Settings-FIST.lingua#r_11X2AGDKXQ69S5GZYNK21Y8CW6), complete change/evidence interface; [Conduct of power operations and maintenance — FIST](../sources/Conduct-of-Power-Operations-and-Maintenance-FIST.lingua#r_4JS2N9S01A3KTMH37TXMVSPPYC), whole relevant physical operating/restoration context.

Read all applicable [Guide to Operational Technology Security — NIST SP 800-82r3](../sources/Operational-Technology-Security-NIST-800-82.lingua#r_760JSBVFVK2NXS6RE3HQJKK8P5) final guidance, the complete relevant [Industrial control and SCADA operation/maintenance — FIST 3-33](../sources/Industrial-Control-and-SCADA-O-and-M-FIST.lingua#r_1REAMQSK7H73C2DY277VJW2ZTB) manual and full primary methods for the chosen protection/control interface. Use an authorized public architecture or a local educational system, with physical process, sensors, controls, time references, communication and auxiliary power all explicit.

Define the required timing/availability and which functions must remain local/autonomous. Model or suitably test delayed/stale/corrupt measurements, a lost time source, unavailable supervisory service and controlled restoration. Relate each event to actual electrical behavior, including what a model excludes. A secure-looking data path does not prove a safe physical response.

Compare two defensive architectures or recovery strategies and explain their tradeoffs for actual equipment and operation. Preserve tested configuration/state, model, calibration/time and uncertainty. Distinguish the final 2023 report from the 2026 public draft and use actual applicable current requirements. The result should support a bounded power/OT engineering claim with evidence another specialist can inspect, while identifying the generic computing, communication and security topics to deepen through their shared subjects.

**Continue:** [An integrated electrical-power-system investigation](../study/An-integrated-electrical-power-system-investigation.lingua#r_06BN864FF9C0AN3EWZJE78Y6Y3).

**Return:** [Electrical power engineering — sources, networks, machines and continuing service](../Electrical-power-engineering.lingua#r_300EPNGATK7PHWNZCQFBXGZFCQ).
